OpenTTD @UPSTREAM_VERSION@, commit
@UPSTREAM_COMMIT@,
built with GFOpenAmigaGCC @COMPILER_RELEASE@ from DalsinAI/amigaopenttd
commit @REPOSITORY_COMMIT@.
